# Database (Drizzle / PostgreSQL)

- Schema lives in `src/lib/db/schema/`; a single Drizzle client in `src/lib/db`.
- **All schema changes go through migrations:** `pnpm db:generate` then `pnpm db:migrate`,
  one migration per logical change, descriptive name. Do not hand-edit generated SQL.
- DB access is owned by `*-server.ts` (reads) and `*-actions.ts` (writes), never by
  components or the transport layer. Parameterized queries only.
- Money in minor units with branded types. Prefer explicit column types and constraints
  (FK, defaults, checks) in the schema - tests assert against the real constraints.
- Reference/rate values are **dated** (effective-from); a change never rewrites already
  billed periods.
